## Featured Projects

### Cloud-Based Analytics Platform for KeyReply
Built a cloud analytics platform that processed 5,000+ healthcare chatbot interactions to surface performance, sentiment, and service quality metrics.

**Tech stack:** AWS, PySpark, FastAPI, HDFS, REST APIs

### Cross-Platform Driver Payments Application for GlossRide
Built and deployed an iOS and Android driver payments application used by 33 private-hire drivers, supporting onboarding, scheduling, invoicing, Stripe payments, and fee calculations.

**Tech stack:** React Native, Node.js, Express.js, Stripe, REST APIs

### Insurance Claims Automation Platform
Built an AI-powered insurance claims platform for dashcam-based claim review, policy reasoning, fraud detection, trust scoring, and payout recommendations.

**Award:** 2nd Place, Agent Forge AI Hackathon  
**Tech stack:** FastAPI, React, VideoDB, Kimi AI

